    Tier-1 EXTENDED set: 187 curves / 171 galaxies (171 SPARC own-model + 16 inherited-model HI curves, 199 points extrapolated beyond the SPARC model's radial support)
    excluded (no baryon model exists in the corpus): 6 THINGS + 23 LITTLE THINGS curves -- enter NO M_b-dependent test (registered scope note)
    environment (Tier 1): 187/187 curves matched on BOTH axes; primary-axis e_N: median 0.00039, p75 0.00053, max 0.00482 -- the registered 0.5-a0 split stays OUT OF RANGE on Tier 1

