  [PASS] V1E [canonical] EXTENDED DEEP REGIME (r/r_M > 2): within-galaxy white-noise floor <= 0.060 dex AND the sag sign persists (mean slope < 0, binomial p < 0.01)
         measured: floor = 0.0524 dex (threshold 0.060; G036 SPARC-only baseline 0.0447; SPARC-only here 0.0447; decomposition: between-galaxy 0.1851, within 0.0524); mean per-galaxy deep slope = -0.1492 dex/dex (94/145 galaxies negative, binomial p = 0.00045) over 145 galaxies
